"layer":"pei","quote":"頵，字温伯。为羽林右监。早卒。","attribution":"《荀氏家传》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2c8f2bee76a8a33cc38","start":12,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-f0017-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-672ab4a2335ddbfc0c8f","layer":"pei","quote":"頵，字温伯","attribution":"《荀氏家传》《晋阳秋》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2c8f2bee76a8a33cc38","start":12,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o033","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-e5d893f8261a404cb8f0","layer":"original","quote":"恽子甝，嗣为散骑常侍〖6〗，进爵广阳乡侯。年三十薨。子頵嗣。﹝四﹞霬官至中领军。薨，谥曰贞侯，追赠骠骑将军。子恺嗣。霬妻，司马景王、文王之妹也；二王皆与亲善。咸熙中，开建五等〖7〗。以霬著勋前朝，改封恺南顿子。﹝五﹞","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":173,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p029","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-672ab4a2335ddbfc0c8f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《荀氏家传》曰：“頵，字温伯。为羽林右监。早卒。頵子崧，字景猷。”《晋阳秋》称：“崧少有志操，雅好文学，孝义和爱，在朝恪勤。位至左、右光禄大夫，开府仪同三司。崧子羡，字令则。清和有才。尚公主。少历显位，年二十八，为北中郎将，徐、兖二州刺史，假节，都督徐、兖、青三州诸军事。在任十年，遇疾解职。卒于家，追赠骠骑将军。羡孙伯子，今御史中丞也。”","attribution":"《荀氏家传》《晋阳秋》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f2c8f2bee76a8a33cc38","start":0,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
